      "message": "This change set \"LOCAL_COMPATIBILITY_SUITE\" to\"robolectric-tests\" for Robolectric tests.\nBefore that, the LOCAL_COMPATIBILITY_SUITE is `empty` for all Robolectric tests even they are test modules. \nThis can be think a bug since all test modules should have `test suite` tag.\n\nThen, this information can be added to the module-info.\ne.g. `module-info.mk`\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/build/make/core/tasks/module-info.mk;l\u003d15?q\u003df:module-info.mk%20compatibility_suites\n\n\nAnd in the aosp/2181295,it only create symbolic link if the test `suite` is not empty.\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/tools/asuite/+/2181295/11/atest/bazel/resources/rules/soong_prebuilt.bzl#199",
